'''Pangseng''' is an [[Adamawa language]] of [[Taraba State]], [[Nigeria]]. It is spoken in Jinlàri (Jimleri), located on the [[Zing, Nigeria|Zing]]-Lankaviri road.  Varieties include Komo, Jega, and others.<ref name="Shimuzu">{{Cite book|title=A Comparative Study of the Mumuye Dialects (Nigeria)|last=Shimizu|first=Kiyoshi|publisher=Verlag von Dietrich Reimer|year=1979|series=Marburger Studien zur Afrika- und Asienkunde|volume=A-14|location=Berlin|pages=13–19}}</ref>

